t-fc8iklz3/out/ext-harwick2.audit.json", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01Mrfxh3KyWiAhQr7F2hjuTt"}], "text_tail": "ut that date is a Tuesday. No value depends on it.\n\nThese open points were already in the extraction, and I kept them:\n- whether the 9-day deadline in band (a) moves when it lands on a Sunday;\n- the \"pay today\" question and the sympathy sentence, which have no dictated wording, so short sentences were written;\n- the promise amount field, which the API defines as `sum` but lists as `amt` in its required fields;\n- no band for 0 or more than 60 days late;\n- no named case for the robot question;\n- no card last-digits field.\n\nFiles are in `out/`:\n- ext-harwick2.policy.json\n- ext-harwick2.audit.json"}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "3ebcee9f231e4ff1b9fb4d48ba3391cd", "pid": 127887, "time": "2026-10-10T23:28:42-0700", "elapsed_s": 216.332, "artifact": "out/ext-harwick2.policy.json", "bands": 3, "identity_fields": ["konto_code", "geburtsdatum", "postleitzahl"], "special_cases": ["already_paid", "dispute", "hardship", "restructuring", "human", "refuse_to_talk", "scam"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "band a calendar-day branch adjustment", "text": "Clause 7.1(a) does not say whether the ninth calendar day after the call is shifted when it falls on a Sunday; taken unadjusted.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "today question wording", "text": "The documents imply a first ask to settle today (7.3 'A first plain refusal to settle today') but dictate no wording; a minimal sentence was written.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "hardship sympathy wording", "text": "10.3 requires 'one short sentence of sympathy' without dictating the words; a minimal sentence was written.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "create_promise amount field", "text": "The tool API defines the amount property as `sum` but lists `amt` as required; the documents do not name the field.", "doc": "openapi.json"}, {"topic": "days past outside bands", "text": "Clause 7.1 defines bands only for 1-60 days past; facilities at 0 or more than 60 days past are not covered.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "robot question", "text": "10.7 robot question has no known special-case name; handled only through phrases.robot_reply (the call continues).", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "card last digits", "text": "No card last-digits field exists and the documents name the card category only as \"store card\".", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "already paid vs. paying this overdue amount", "text": "10.2 ends 'A payment of this very overdue amount is NOT what 10.1 covers', which seems to contradict 10.1 'Already paid'; the extraction keeps 10.1 for a customer saying the facility is already paid and 10.2 for not my debt / never held / settled and closed.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "human request declined help", "text": "10.5 'ask once whether this assistant can help; treatment 10.6 otherwise' does not make clear when the 10.6 refusal treatment applies instead of the hl-desk transfer on insistence.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "whole-batch refusal notes", "text": "9.4 'A whole-batch refusal closes with no notes taken contrary to clause 11.2' is garbled; taken to mean notes per 11.1 (no transfer), but the note code for a refused read-back is not named.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "write failure statement", "text": "11.5 'the failure is stated' dictates no wording.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "band c first attempt floor", "text": "7.2(b) does not say whether the first band-(c) attempt names the floor when the full amount was already refused; taken as no (the floor is the second attempt).", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "mail date", "text": "Mail S-72 is headed 'Wed 13 Oct 2026', but 13 Oct 2026 is a Tuesday; no value depends on it.", "doc": "sources/000-01-amendment-mail.txt"}], "audit_fixed": ["special_cases[refuse_to_talk].action changed from close HL-FULL/hl-refuse to note hl-refuse (ends_call true): 10.6 sets hl-refuse on every remaining facility and ends under the 11.3 rank, so an earlier recorded payment still gives HL-PAY and the reason is the first non-cleared facility's note, not always hl-refuse.", "Sources made more precise: konto_code requirement now cites M-1 for order and 4.2 for format/wording; bands a/b cite 7.2 attempt schedule; amounts cite 6.2 and 8.1; scam case cites clause 2.4; phrases/multi_product/promise_write sources extended.", "Added unresolved entries: contradictory last sentence of 10.2, ambiguous 10.5 'treatment 10.6 otherwise', garbled 9.4, undictated wording for 11.5 failure statement, band c first-attempt floor not stated, mail weekday mismatch."], "audit_unresolved": ["Whether the 9th-calendar-day branch of band (a) is shifted when it falls on a Sunday (7.1(a)).", "No wording for the today question (7.3) or the hardship sympathy sentence (10.3); minimal sentences written.", "create_promise amount property: API defines `sum` but requires `amt`; documents silent.", "Facilities at 0 or over 60 days past are not covered by any band.", "Robot question has no known special-case name; handled via phrases.robot_reply.", "No card last-digits field; card named 'store card'.", "10.2 'A payment of this very overdue amount is NOT what 10.1 covers' conflicts with 10.1.", "10.5 'treatment 10.6 otherwise' is unclear about when refusal treatment applies.", "9.4 whole-batch refusal note handling is garbled; no note code named for it.", "11.5 'the failure is stated' has no wording.", "Band (c) first attempt: floor-if-full-refused not stated.", "Mail S-72 is headed 'Wed 13 Oct 2026', but that date is a Tuesday (no value depends on it)."], "defaulted_without_source": [], "unknown_special_cases": [], "api_mapping_notes": []}
